        "mat_fi_text_1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NANGA is committed to high-quality down and to manufacturing in Japan. We use only European down that is imported and then washed in Japan, so it arrives clean and nearly free of the odor down can carry. Getting the most out of down takes advanced refining, and down refined in Japan is among the cleanest and highest quality anywhere. Every product is then sewn in Japan by skilled craftspeople.</p>"
          }
