          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>NANGA knows the strengths of each quilt construction and chooses the best one for every product.</p><p>Our most advanced sleeping bags combine trapezoid box quilting with a 3D shape to get the most out of the down. They keep you warm efficiently in any sleeping position without feeling restrictive, and a tapered foot section cuts weight.</p>",
