          "settings": {
            "title": "AURORA-TEX®"
          }
        },
        "mat_fabrics_text_1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A nylon fabric with a microporous polyurethane waterproof coating. It solves the usual trade-off, where more waterproofing means less breathability, at a very high level. As a 2-layer fabric, it offers 20,000 mm of water resistance and 6,000 g/m²/24 hr of breathability.</p>"
